<Page
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | VT Dispensary Directory"
  description="How VT Dispensary Directory makes money, what an affiliate link is, and why it does not affect which dispensaries we list or how we rank them."
  label="Disclosure"
  heading="Affiliate disclosure"
  intro="Plain terms, because the useful version of this page is the honest one."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      Some outbound links on this site are affiliate links. If you click one and go on to
      make a purchase, we may earn a commission from that dispensary or its menu provider.
      You pay nothing extra. Prices are the same whether you arrive through us or type the
      address yourself.
    </p>

    <h2>Which links</h2>
    <p>
      The links that may be monetised are the <strong>Visit Website</strong> and
      <strong>View Menu</strong> buttons on dispensary listings. These route through
      <code>/affiliate/click/</code> so the click can be counted. That route is marked
      noindex and passes no ranking signal.
    </p>
    <p>
      Links inside our written guides, and links to the Cannabis Control Board or other
      official sources, are never affiliate links.
    </p>

    <h2>What it does not affect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Which dispensaries appear. Every licensed Vermont retailer is listed regardless of any commercial relationship.</li>
      <li>The order they appear in. Sorting is alphabetical or by location, never by commission.</li>
      <li>What we write about them. Editorial notes are not for sale.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Where a dispensary has paid for placement in a specific promotional slot, that slot is
      labelled <strong>Sponsored</strong>. If it is not labelled, it is not paid.
    </p>

    <h2>Why disclose it this thoroughly</h2>
    <p>
      Because the FTC requires disclosure of material connections, and because a directory
      that hides its incentives is not much use to the person reading it. If you would judge
      our recommendations differently knowing how we are paid, you should know how we are paid.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      Dispensaries interested in sponsorship can find the details on the
      <a href="/advertise/">advertise</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
</Page>
